§ `Section 386AF(7) to (10): what the register must hold and how it is entered`

-- (7): four limbs. (aa) bites "if applicable", that is where s 386AFA(3) applies; (b) bites if a change occurs.
-- src:25731 | (7) A company or foreign company must ensure that its register —
-- src:25733 | (a) contains such particulars of the company’s or foreign
-- src:25734 | company’s registrable individual controllers and
-- src:25735 | registrable corporate controllers as may be prescribed;
-- src:25737 | (aa) contains the note and prescribed particulars required under
-- src:25738 | section 386AFA(3), if applicable;
-- src:25742 | (b) is updated if any change to the prescribed particulars
-- src:25743 | mentioned in paragraph (a) or (aa) occurs; and
-- src:25747 | (c) is kept in such form and at such place as may be prescribed.
@ref s 386AF(7) (src:25731-25747)
GIVEN `the register contains the prescribed particulars of the company's or foreign company's registrable individual controllers and registrable corporate controllers` IS A BOOLEAN
      `section 386AFA(3) applies to the company or foreign company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the register contains the note and prescribed particulars required under section 386AFA(3)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a change to the prescribed particulars has occurred` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the register has been updated for that change` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the register is kept in the prescribed form and at the prescribed place` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 386AF(7) the register is as the subsection requires` MEANS
    IF    `the register contains the prescribed particulars of the company's or foreign company's registrable individual controllers and registrable corporate controllers`
       AND ((NOT `section 386AFA(3) applies to the company or foreign company`) OR `the register contains the note and prescribed particulars required under section 386AFA(3)`)
       AND ((NOT `a change to the prescribed particulars has occurred`) OR `the register has been updated for that change`)
       AND `the register is kept in the prescribed form and at the prescribed place`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A company or foreign company must ensure that its register — (a) contains ...; (aa) contains the note and prescribed particulars required under section 386AFA(3), if applicable; (b) is updated if any change ... occurs; and (c) is kept in such form and at such place as may be prescribed" (a duty not met: the provision's own question; fork line F-AF2)

-- (7) as four duties with no time limit of their own and no consequence in the subsection: no breach path (NOTES.md, "Rules with no breach path").
-- src:25731 | (7) A company or foreign company must ensure that its register —
