-- src:25734 | company’s registrable individual controllers and
-- src:25735 | registrable corporate controllers as may be prescribed;
@ref s 386AF(7)(a) (src:25731-25735)
GIVEN `the company or foreign company` IS A Party
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 386AF act`
`s 386AF(7)(a) a company or foreign company must ensure that its register contains the prescribed particulars` MEANS
    PARTY `the company or foreign company`
    MUST `s 386AF(7)(a) ensure that the register contains the prescribed particulars of its registrable individual controllers and registrable corporate controllers`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    -- no LEST: no deadline is modelled for this duty; dropped clause: LEST BREACH BY `the company or foreign company` BECAUSE "the register did not contain the prescribed particulars of the registrable individual controllers and registrable corporate controllers (s 386AF(7)(a), (12)(b))" (assumed, not ruled; see notes/lest-without-deadline.md) [class: maintenance; see notes]

