    -- no LEST: no deadline is modelled for this duty; dropped clause: LEST BREACH BY `the company or foreign company` BECAUSE "the register did not contain the note and prescribed particulars required under section 386AFA(3) (s 386AF(7)(aa), (12)(b))" (assumed, not ruled; see notes/lest-without-deadline.md) [class: maintenance; see notes]

