        ELSE `s 386AF(13) the officer of the foreign company is guilty of the offence` `the foreign company fails to comply with subsection (4), (4A), (5) or (6), whichever is applicable` `the foreign company fails to comply with subsection (7), (8), (9) or (11)` `the person is an officer of the foreign company who is in default, as section 408(3) gives that meaning` EQUALS JUST TRUE)
