@ref s 386AFA(4) (src:25868-25885)
GIVEN `the company or foreign company` IS A Party
      `the prescribed period, in days` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 386AFA act`
`s 386AFA(4) a company or foreign company must enter the matters mentioned in subsection (3) within the prescribed period` MEANS
    PARTY `the company or foreign company`
    MUST `s 386AFA(3) enter in the register of controllers the note and the prescribed particulars of each director with executive control and each chief executive officer`
    WITHIN `the prescribed period, in days`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the company or foreign company` BECAUSE "the company did not enter the matters mentioned in subsection (3) in its register of controllers within the prescribed period (s 386AFA(4), (7))"

-- (5): update the register within the prescribed period after the date the company knows of a change in the particulars entered under (3)(b).
