      `the company or foreign company has updated its register of controllers to reflect the change` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the day the company or foreign company updated its register of controllers` IS A DATE
      `the prescribed period, in days` IS A NUMBER
      `the date asked` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 386AFA(5) the company or foreign company has updated its register within the prescribed period` MEANS
    `s 386AF(8) timing: the act was done in time` `the company or foreign company has updated its register of controllers to reflect the change` `the day the company or foreign company updated its register of controllers` `the date on which the company or foreign company knows, or has reasonable grounds to believe, that a change in the particulars entered under subsection (3)(b) has occurred` `the prescribed period, in days` `the date asked`   -- FALSE-kind where late ("must, within the prescribed period after the date on which the company ... knows, or has reasonable grounds to believe, that any change ... has occurred, update its register": a period the text fixes in its own words: ruling (a)); NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording) while the period has not run out

-- src:25890 | (5) A company or foreign company must, within the prescribed
-- src:25891 | period after the date on which the company or foreign company
