-- src:25894 | subsection (3)(b) has occurred, update its register of controllers to
-- src:25895 | reflect the change.
@ref s 386AFA(5) (src:25890-25895)
GIVEN `the company or foreign company` IS A Party
      `the prescribed period, in days` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 386AFA act`
`s 386AFA(5) a company or foreign company must update its register of controllers within the prescribed period after it knows of a change` MEANS
    PARTY `the company or foreign company`
    MUST `s 386AFA(5) update the register of controllers to reflect a change in the particulars entered under subsection (3)(b)`
    WITHIN `the prescribed period, in days`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the company or foreign company` BECAUSE "the company did not update its register of controllers within the prescribed period after it knew of a change in the particulars entered under subsection (3)(b) (s 386AFA(5), (7))"

-- (6): if the company enters a registrable controller's particulars under s 386AF(9), it must at the same time enter a note.
-- src:25897 | (6) If a company or foreign company mentioned in subsection (1)
-- src:25898 | enters the particulars of a registrable controller in its register of
-- src:25899 | controllers under section 386AF(9), the company or foreign company
-- src:25900 | must, at the same time, enter in its register of controllers a note
-- src:25901 | stating —
-- src:25903 | (a) that each director with executive control and each chief
-- src:25904 | executive officer of the company or foreign company is no
-- src:25905 | longer taken to be a registrable controller of the company
-- src:25906 | or foreign company under subsection (2); and
-- src:25908 | (b) the date on which the particulars of the registrable
-- src:25909 | controller were entered in its register of controllers under
-- src:25910 | section 386AF(9).
@ref s 386AFA(6) (src:25897-25910)
GIVEN `the company or foreign company is one mentioned in subsection (1) and has entered the particulars of a registrable controller in its register under section 386AF(9)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company or foreign company entered the note that subsection (6) describes at the same time` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 386AFA(6) the company or foreign company has entered the note at the same time` MEANS
    IF NOT `the company or foreign company is one mentioned in subsection (1) and has entered the particulars of a registrable controller in its register under section 386AF(9)`
    THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): subsection (6) bites "If a company or foreign company mentioned in subsection (1) enters the particulars of a registrable controller ... under section 386AF(9)"; where it has not, the subsection does not speak (a duty whose "if" is unmet: the case-by-case ruling of 2026-11-05; fork line F-AFA2)
    ELSE (IF `the company or foreign company entered the note that subsection (6) describes at the same time`
          THEN JUST TRUE
          ELSE JUST FALSE)   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the company or foreign company must, at the same time, enter in its register of controllers a note stating ..." (the note was not entered at the same time)

