-- src:25910 | section 386AF(9).
@ref s 386AFA(6) (src:25897-25910)
GIVEN `the company or foreign company` IS A Party
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 386AFA act`
`s 386AFA(6) a company or foreign company must at the same time enter the note` MEANS
    PARTY `the company or foreign company`
    MUST `s 386AFA(6) enter in the register of controllers the note that subsection (6) describes`
    WITHIN 0
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the company or foreign company` BECAUSE "the company did not enter the note at the same time as it entered the particulars of the registrable controller under section 386AF(9) (s 386AFA(6), (7))"

-- (7): the offence for failing to comply with (3), (4), (5) or (6); the company and every officer in default are each guilty; fine up to $25,000.
-- src:25912 | (7) If a company or foreign company fails to comply with
-- src:25913 | subsection (3), (4), (5) or (6), the company or foreign company,
-- src:25914 | and every officer of the company or foreign company who is in
-- src:25915 | default, shall each be guilty of an offence and shall each be liable on
-- src:25916 | conviction to a fine not exceeding $25,000.
@ref s 386AFA(7) (src:25912-25916)
GIVEN `the company or foreign company fails to comply with subsection (3), (4), (5) or (6)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 386AFA(7) the company or foreign company is guilty of the offence` MEANS
    IF `the company or foreign company fails to comply with subsection (3), (4), (5) or (6)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the provision's own question; split site (i), fork line F-AF6): "If a company or foreign company fails to comply with subsection (3), (4), (5) or (6), the company or foreign company, and every officer ... shall each be guilty of an offence"

-- src:25912 | (7) If a company or foreign company fails to comply with
-- src:25913 | subsection (3), (4), (5) or (6), the company or foreign company,
-- src:25914 | and every officer of the company or foreign company who is in
-- src:25915 | default, shall each be guilty of an offence and shall each be liable on
-- src:25916 | conviction to a fine not exceeding $25,000.
@ref s 386AFA(7) (src:25912-25916)
GIVEN `the company or foreign company fails to comply with subsection (3), (4), (5) or (6)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is an officer of the company or foreign company who is in default, as section 408(3) gives that meaning` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 386AFA(7) the officer of the company or foreign company is guilty of the offence` MEANS
    IF `the company or foreign company fails to comply with subsection (3), (4), (5) or (6)` AND `the person is an officer of the company or foreign company who is in default, as section 408(3) gives that meaning`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the provision's own question; split site (i), fork line F-AF6): "the company or foreign company, and every officer of the company or foreign company who is in default, shall each be guilty of an offence"

-- src:25912 | (7) If a company or foreign company fails to comply with
-- src:25913 | subsection (3), (4), (5) or (6), the company or foreign company,
-- src:25914 | and every officer of the company or foreign company who is in
-- src:25915 | default, shall each be guilty of an offence and shall each be liable on
-- src:25916 | conviction to a fine not exceeding $25,000.
@ref s 386AFA(7) (src:25912-25916)
GIVEN `the company or foreign company fails to comply with subsection (3), (4), (5) or (6)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is the company or foreign company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is an officer of the company or foreign company who is in default, as section 408(3) gives that meaning` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE Penalty
`s 386AFA(7) the most the company or foreign company or an officer in default may be sentenced to on conviction` MEANS
    IF (IF `the person is the company or foreign company`
        THEN `s 386AFA(7) the company or foreign company is guilty of the offence` `the company or foreign company fails to comply with subsection (3), (4), (5) or (6)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
        ELSE `s 386AFA(7) the officer of the company or foreign company is guilty of the offence` `the company or foreign company fails to comply with subsection (3), (4), (5) or (6)` `the person is an officer of the company or foreign company who is in default, as section 408(3) gives that meaning` EQUALS JUST TRUE)
    THEN JUST (Penalty OF 25000, 0, FALSE, FALSE)
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the subsection states a penalty only for the person it makes guilty

-- (9): despite anything in the Part, a reference in the listed provisions to a controller or registrable controller does not include a director or chief executive
-- officer taken to be a registrable controller under (2). Read as the question "does the reference include the person?": the text's own "does not include" is JUST FALSE.
DECLARE `s 386AFA(9) provision` IS ONE OF
    `s 386AFA(9) section 386AF(9) or (10)`
    `s 386AFA(9) section 386AG(1) or (2)`
    `s 386AFA(9) section 386AH(1) or (7)`
    `s 386AFA(9) section 386AI(1)`
    `s 386AFA(9) section 386AIA(1) or (6)`
    `s 386AFA(9) section 386AJ(1)`
    `s 386AFA(9) section 386AK(1)`
    `s 386AFA(9) some other provision of this Part`

-- src:25942 | (9) Despite anything in this Part, a reference in section 386AF(9) or
-- src:25943 | (10), 386AG(1) or (2), 386AH(1) or (7), 386AI(1), 386AIA(1) or (6),
-- src:25944 | 386AJ(1) or 386AK(1) to a controller or a registrable controller does
-- src:25945 | not include a director or chief executive officer taken to be a
-- src:25946 | registrable controller under subsection (2).
@ref s 386AFA(9) (src:25942-25946)
GIVEN provision IS A `s 386AFA(9) provision`
      `the person is a director or chief executive officer taken to be a registrable controller under subsection (2)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 386AFA(9) the reference to a controller or a registrable controller includes the person` MEANS
    IF `the person is a director or chief executive officer taken to be a registrable controller under subsection (2)` AND (CONSIDER provision
                                                                                                                                WHEN `s 386AFA(9) some other provision of this Part` THEN FALSE
                                                                                                                                OTHERWISE TRUE)
    THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Despite anything in this Part, a reference in section 386AF(9) or (10), 386AG(1) or (2), 386AH(1) or (7), 386AI(1), 386AIA(1) or (6), 386AJ(1) or 386AK(1) to a controller or a registrable controller does not include a director or chief executive officer taken to be a registrable controller under subsection (2)" (a flat negative)
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the subsection names eleven references and one kind of person; it says nothing of any other reference or person
